{"id": "QuestString_STR_HQ1103120_complete_desc", "canonicalSource": "???", "sourceCulture": "ko-KR", "source": "챈가룽 상단 분소에서 나니아와 대화", "sourceSha256": "84cdd9edaf90f1d3dc623ca46a6618333f7891d400f601813706eb1359e26333", "translation": "Porozmawiaj z Nanią w filii karawany Chengarung", "status": "draft"}
